// Conformance suite: Euclidean division and modulo at all four sign
// combinations. Turpentine's remainder is always non-negative, and this is
// the program that pins that down for every backend.
println(17 / 5);
println(17 % 5);
println(-17 / 5);
println(-17 % 5);
println(17 / -5);
println(17 % -5);
println(-17 / -5);
println(-17 % -5);
